---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { photographerBioPhoto, heroPhotograph } from '../data/photographs';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<MainLayout
  title={`About the Photographer | ${siteConfig.brandName}`}
  description="The personal story, philosophy, and beginning photography journey of photo.pichi.ra — exploring wildlife, nature, rented gear, practice RAW files, and post-processing."
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <!-- Header Hero -->
    <header class="about-hero">
      <div class="container-editorial">
        <span class="about-eyebrow">Personal Story</span>
        <h1 class="about-title">Hello, I'm behind photo.pichi.ra</h1>
        <p class="about-hero-lead">
          A personal journey of slowing down, observing the outdoors, and discovering beauty through the camera lens.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Visual Feature Frame: Photographer Portrait -->
    <div class="container-editorial">
      <div class="about-feature-image-wrap">
        <Image
          src={photographerBioPhoto.src}
          alt={photographerBioPhoto.alt}
          width={1200}
          height={750}
          format="webp"
          quality={88}
          loading="eager"
          class="about-feature-img"
        />
        <span class="feature-img-caption">Behind the lens &bull; Exploring the outdoors, one frame at a time</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Narrative -->
    <section class="about-narrative">
      <div class="container-editorial narrative-inner">
        <!-- Section: The Beginning -->
        <div class="narrative-block">
          <span class="block-tag">The Beginning</span>
          <h2 class="block-title">Two months into a lifelong curiosity</h2>
          <div class="block-prose">
            <p>
              I recently started this photography journey — roughly two months ago. There was no grand epiphany or formal masterclass; it simply started with a desire to spend more time outdoors and truly look at the living world around me.
            </p>
            <p>
              When you pick up a camera with intention, the ordinary transforms. You begin noticing how the first beam of morning sun warms the moss on tree bark, how quietly a bird perches before taking flight, and how animal expressions carry unmistakable character.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section: The Gear & Approach -->
        <div class="narrative-block">
          <span class="block-tag">Equipment &amp; Exploration</span>
          <h2 class="block-title">Rented gear &amp; open horizons</h2>
          <div class="block-prose">
            <p>
              I don't own an expensive camera kit. Instead, whenever I plan an outing to a park, woodland, backwaters, or mountain trail, I rent a DSLR or mirrorless body along with different lenses.
            </p>
            <p>
              Renting has been an incredible way to learn. One weekend I might rent a telephoto zoom to study skittish waterbirds at a distance without disturbing their natural rhythms. Another weekend, I might try a prime lens for intimate creative portraits, golden hour foliage, or landscape vistas. Every outing is a fresh experiment in handling, framing, and learning how light behaves.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Callout Quote -->
        <div class="quote-callout">
          <blockquote>
            "Photography is about observation as much as it is about capturing an image. Sometimes it is a bird resting quietly, sometimes an animal in its natural habitat, or simply the way light falls across a landscape."
          </blockquote>
        </div>

        <!-- Section: The Digital Darkroom & Practice RAWs -->
        <div class="narrative-block">
          <span class="block-tag">The Digital Darkroom</span>
          <h2 class="block-title">Learning Lightroom &amp; Photoshop</h2>
          <div class="block-prose">
            <p>
              Capturing the frame in the field is only half the joy. Once back from a shoot, I spend hours developing my editing workflow inside Adobe Lightroom and studying Photoshop techniques.
            </p>
            <p>
              My goal in post-processing is never to create artificial, oversaturated images. Instead, I focus on bringing out the authentic tones of nature — the rich deep greens of Munnar tea hills, warm Alleppey morning ochres, soft river reflections, and natural shadows.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Practice RAW Files Credit Box -->
          <div class="practice-raw-callout">
            <div class="callout-badge">
              <span class="badge-dot"></span>
              <span>Workflow &amp; Skill Development</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="callout-title">Testing on Professional RAW Practice Files</h3>
            <p class="callout-text">
              Testing out my editing workflow on professional RAW practice files! 🎨✨ To sharpen my color grading, dynamic range handling, and tone curve precision, I practice editing on high-grade RAW files kindly provided by fellow creators.
            </p>
            <div class="credits-citation">
              <strong>CREDITS:</strong>
              <p>Free RAW practice files provided by <strong>James Reader</strong>:</p>
              <ul class="credits-links-list">
                <li>
                  Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/james.reader" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@james.reader</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                  Website: <a href="https://www.jamesreader.uk/raw-files" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jamesreader.uk/raw-files</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                  YouTube: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jamesreader" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">youtube.com/jamesreader</a>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="callout-tags">
                <span>#photoediting</span> <span>#colorgrade</span> <span>#postprocessing</span> <span>#lightroom</span> <span>#creativeediting</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Two-column visual and interest breakdown -->
        <div class="interests-grid">
          <div class="interest-col">
            <div class="interest-img-wrap">
              <Image
                src={heroPhotograph.src}
                alt={heroPhotograph.alt}
                width={800}
                height={600}
                format="webp"
                quality={88}
                loading="lazy"
                class="interest-img"
              />
              <span class="interest-img-caption">{heroPhotograph.title} &bull; {heroPhotograph.location}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="interest-col text-col">
            <span class="block-tag">Domains</span>
            <h3 class="interest-heading">Six Areas of Exploration</h3>
            <ul class="interest-list">
              <li>
                <strong>Landscapes:</strong> Chasing sunrise over Alleppey backwaters, misty Munnar ridges, and open skies.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Wildlife:</strong> Documenting animals in their habitats with patience, respect, and non-intrusive observation.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Birds:</strong> Studying wetlands herons, morning ducks, and quiet perches.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Nature:</strong> Finding beauty in micro-textures, morning dew, foliage, and earth.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Creative:</strong> Experimenting with warm candlelight, shadows, mood, and digital tone curves.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Portraits:</strong> Character-rich human studies and editorial color grading practice.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section: Follow the Journey -->
        <div class="narrative-block follow-block">
          <span class="block-tag">Continuous Learning</span>
          <h2 class="block-title">Follow along</h2>
          <div class="block-prose">
            <p>
              This website serves as my quiet digital exhibition and archive. As I take more weekend trips, rent new lenses, and continue learning Lightroom and Photoshop, new photographs will find their home here.
            </p>
            <p>
              If you appreciate the outdoors, nature photography, or watching a creative journey unfold from day one, you can follow me on Instagram:
            </p>
            <div class="about-action">
              <a
                href={siteConfig.instagram.url}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="btn btn-primary"
              >
                <span>Follow {siteConfig.instagram.handle} on Instagram</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-top: var(--space-3xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
  }

  .about-hero {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .about-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-olive);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.2vw, 4.2rem);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .about-hero-lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.6vw, 1.35rem);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .about-feature-image-wrap {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .about-feature-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 600px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .feature-img-caption {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about-narrative {
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .narrative-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .narrative-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .block-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-forest);
  }

  .block-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .block-prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .block-prose p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* Practice RAW Callout */
  .practice-raw-callout {
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-left: 4px solid #E2A03F;
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .callout-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #B57416;
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #E2A03F;
  }

  .callout-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .callout-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .credits-citation {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .credits-citation strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .credits-links-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .credits-links-list a {
    color: var(--accent-forest);
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .credits-links-list a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-olive);
  }

  .callout-tags {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* Quote Callout */
  .quote-callout {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-xl);
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-olive);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
  }

  .quote-callout blockquote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.75rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Interests Grid */
  .interests-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .interests-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
      padding: var(--space-2xl);
    }
  }

  .interest-img-wrap {
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .interest-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .interest-img-caption {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .text-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .interest-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .interest-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .interest-list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .interest-list li::before {
    content: '•';
    color: var(--accent-olive);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: -2px;
  }

  .interest-list strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .follow-block {
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .about-action {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }
</style>
